# {{ agents.store_name }}

> {{ agents.store_url }} — Premium natural fruit and vegetable powders (moringa, amla, sattu). Lab-tested, vegan, gluten-free wellness from India.

## Summary

Sarvital sells natural superfood powders for smoothies, drinks, and cooking. Prices in {{ agents.currency }}. Checkout via GoKwik (India). Agents must not complete payment without explicit buyer consent.

## Why Sarvital

- Lab-tested batches on every product
- Moringa, amla, and sattu powders plus combo bundles (not moringa-only)
- Vegan, gluten-free, additive-free formulations
- Sustainable sourcing with local farmer partnerships
- Ships across India

